comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-26T21:27:34.572Z","harness:codex","GitHub intake: GH-1126 https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1126. Reused the canonical annotation-facet grammar task. Red reproduction: comments/learnings reject --text even though notes/remind and collection concepts use text; human recovery can truncate before suggested_retry."
  "2026-08-26T21:34:26.811Z","harness:codex","TDD red: shared registration spec proves comments, notes, and learnings all reject the convergent --text alias before reaching their SDK adapters."
  "2026-08-26T22:51:39.094Z","harness:codex","Evidence for the implemented slice: comments, notes, and learnings now accept the convergent --text alias and reject conflicting positional/text payloads through one typed resolver; recovery bundles put suggested_retry first. Fresh-directory acceptance persisted and projected one entry from each collection. The linked sandbox-safe suite passed 134/134, while repository gates passed pnpm build, pnpm lint, 584 files and 8025 tests with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage, pnpm audit clean, and Trivy HIGH/CRITICAL vuln+secret+misconfig clean. This closes only the GitHub #1126 alias slice; the broader convergent grammar programme remains open for its other command families."
